    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n83793" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πληκ-τίζομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bandy blows with</i> one, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀργαλέον δὲ πληκτίζεσθ᾽ ἀλόχοισι
					Διός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					21.499
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>beat one's breast</i> for grief, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.574
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>toy amorously,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετὰ τῆς σῆς πυγῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ec.</u>
					964
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τινα, πρὸς ἀλλήλους,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Herod.
				5.29
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				11.8.5
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				46.18
			</span></i>: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				51.12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			
				Act.
			 is only f.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.735d
			</span></i>.</div>
